# Web Dashboard environment configuration
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Copy this file to `.env` and adjust. On Windows you don't need to do this
# by hand — `start-dashboard.bat` creates `.env` for you on first run.
#
# DATABASE_URL (required) — SQLite database location.
# NOTE on relative paths: Prisma resolves them against the SCHEMA directory
# (prisma/), NOT the repo root. `file:../db/custom.db` therefore lands at
# <repo>/db/custom.db — the location the co-located agent auto-detects. An
# ABSOLUTE path with forward slashes is the most portable form:
#   Windows: DATABASE_URL=file:D:/AI-web-app/web-dashboard-v3/db/custom.db
#   macOS:   DATABASE_URL=file:/Users/you/web-dashboard-v3/db/custom.db
DATABASE_URL=file:../db/custom.db

# Optional — override the auto-bootstrapped admin account (defaults shown).
# The admin user is created automatically on first start.
# ADMIN_EMAIL=admin@dashboard.local
# ADMIN_PASSWORD=admin123456
